{"id":6,"createdAt":"2026-05-15T01:25:53.489Z","runId":"vfy-mp68jpfh-x3an","runKind":"verify","domainName":"blocks-world","problem":"bw-1","isCustomDomain":false,"savedDomainId":null,"transformerHash":null,"rendererHash":null,"llmProvider":"claude","stateIndex":3,"totalStates":5,"extractorModelId":"claude-sonnet-4-5","extractorVersion":"unvis-v1","imageHash":"e5490cee3222b02cf8ac1adfd0f75dd9ef45dae34dd11efc69370d278d5d24ce","imagePath":null,"expected":["(clear b)","(holding a)","(on b c)","(ontable c)"],"extracted":["(ontable c)","(on b c)","(clear b)","(holding a)"],"scope":["clear","holding","on","ontable"],"tp":["(clear b)","(holding a)","(on b c)","(ontable c)"],"fp":[],"fn":[],"precision":1,"recall":1,"parseFailure":false,"rawText":"I'll analyze the image to identify the ground predicates that hold in this blocks-world state.\n\n**Analysis:**\n\nFrom the image, I can see:\n1. Block A (red/pink) - appears to be held by a gripper (shown by the line above it)\n2. Block B (cyan) - is on top of Block C\n3. Block C (blue) - is on the table\n4. The brown surface represents the table\n\n**Mapping to predicates:**\n\n- Block C is on the table: `(ontable c)`\n- Block B is on Block C: `(on b c)`\n- Block B has nothing on top of it: `(clear b)`\n- Block A is being held by the gripper: `(holding a)`\n- Since the gripper is holding block A, the hand is NOT empty (so `handempty` does NOT hold)\n\n**Ground predicates that hold:**\n1. `(ontable c)` - C is on the table\n2. `(on b c)` - B is on C\n3. `(clear b)` - B has nothing on top\n4. `(holding a)` - The gripper is holding A\n\nPREDICATES_JSON: [\"(ontable c)\", \"(on b c)\", \"(clear b)\", \"(holding a)\"]","feedbackId":null,"humanLabeller":null,"imageProvenance":null}
