ck: g is on table, h is on g, i is on h, i is clear\n- The hand is empty (no block is being held)\n\nPREDICATES_JSON: [\"(ontable a)\", \"(on b a)\", \"(on c b)\", \"(clear c)\", \"(ontable d)\", \"(on e d)\", \"(on f e)\", \"(clear f)\", \"(ontable g)\", \"(on h g)\", \"(on i h)\", \"(clear i)\", \"(handempty)\"]","feedbackId":null,"humanLabeller":null,"imageProvenance":null}
