n- b is on a\n- c is on b\n- e is on d\n- h is on g\n- i is on h\n- j is on i\n\n**clear**: Blocks with nothing on top\n- c is clear (top of left stack)\n- e is clear (top of middle stack)\n- j is clear (top of right stack)\n\n**holding**: The gripper is holding a block\n- f is being held\n\n**handempty**: The hand is empty\n- NOT true (the hand is holding f)\n\nPREDICATES_JSON: [\"(ontable a)\", \"(ontable d)\", \"(ontable g)\", \"(on b a)\", \"(on c b)\", \"(on e d)\", \"(on h g)\", \"(on i h)\", \"(on j i)\", \"(clear c)\", \"(clear e)\", \"(clear j)\", \"(holding f)\"]","feedbackId":null,"humanLabeller":null,"imageProvenance":null}
